      "id": "claim_950a7a28f6a04bf8a2ee1b0442e62e70",
      "statement": "Scheduled-property handling requires matching each claimed item to the schedule and identifiers, establishing ownership or financial interest, location, use, condition, cause, value, repairability, custody, and salvage, with qualified evaluation for specialized identity, authentication, provenance, restoration, or valuation questions.",
