      "id": "claim_13ca33a267bb477481b0956616f99d55",
      "statement": "When salvage inspection may be needed, the claims manual requires damaged property to be retained for 60 days, segregated and protected, tracked through custody or vendors, and not disposed of until subrogation review is complete or release authority is documented.",
