      "statement": "The claims manual requires referral and authority control for material exposures and disputed or specialized issues: losses above $25,000 require referral before settlement authority, disputed coverage and reservations of rights require referral, unresolved coverage requires a reservation within 10 days, and condominium exposure at or above $100,000 requires large-loss reporting.",
