      "statement": "Closure requires documented final handling of each material property interest, payment, authority approval, evidence and salvage status, recovery disposition, communications, and unresolved issue; condominium, scheduled-property, and recovery records must be reopened or kept active when credible new information changes damage, cause, interest, or recovery status.",
